umer Information Accreditation and Approvals State Authorizations Institutional Review Board Employment Faculty/Staff Technology Resources Public & Media Relations Sexual Misconduct Policy Title IX Contact Us Campus Maps Strategic Plan President's Welcome Home > Adjunct Faculty for the Division of Health & Sciences Adjunct Faculty for the Division of Health & Sciences DESCRIPTION: Thomas University an independent, not-for-profit, institution of higher education with undergraduate and graduate programs in Thomasville, Georgia seeks applicants for adjunct faculty for the Division of Health & Sciences. Positions are available on an as needed basis for both on-campus and online instruction. TYPICAL QUALIFICATIONS: · Candidates must hold a master’s degree or Ph.D. in the teaching discipline. · Practical employment experience is preferred. · Previous teaching experience preferred but not required. · Ability to maintain confidentiality and exhibit good judgment in making decisions concurrent with College policy · Ability to work cooperatively with all constituents · Excellent written and oral communication skills · Knowledge of course content SUPPLEMENTAL INFORMATION: All applicants must be adept in responding to student writing. To apply for opportunities, please view the Thomas University website at www.thomasu.edu/employment and click on the application link at https://apply.appone.com/job/689265e7251011d16765d2f9 . Also send an email with the subject noting “Health & Sciences Adjunct” including curriculum vita, three current references, and order official transcripts to be sent to Anna Benefield, Office of Human Resources: abenefield@thomasu.edu. All electronic submissions should be in Microsoft Word or PDF format. CONTACT INFORMATION: For questions about this faculty opening, please contact Kim Cribb at kcribb@thomasu.edu. For more information or questions regarding submission of application materials please contact Anna Benefield at abenefield@thomasu.edu. Thomas University is located in Thomasville, Georgia, approximately 35 miles north of Tallahassee, Florida. Thomas University Education that Engages ...Empowers... Transforms ™ 1550 Magnolia Street Thomasville, GA 31792 229.226.1621 Contact Us Peoples Bookstore & Spirit Shop HawkLink Student Accounts Financial Aid Campus Public & Media Relations Employment University Privacy Policy Consumer Information Website Feedback Follow Us thomas/1950/ @ThomasU1950 thomasuniversity ThomasUniversityTU © 2026 Thomas University. All Rights Reserved. Website developed and hosted by Pen Publishing Interactive"
